<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-RAIN HOLDS UP S.AFRICA V INDIA FINAL TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RAIN HOLDS UP S.AFRICA V INDIA FINAL TEST.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A thunderstorm half an hour before lunch ruled out further play before tea on the fifth and last day of the third and final test at the Wanderers on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 410-9 and 266-8 declared, South Africa 321 and 76-5.</p>
